{"server":"cn","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_04_end","groupId":"act47side","stageId":"act47side_04","title":"晴空湍流","storyCode":"UR-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act47side/level_act47side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"458c049484dd5ce6f0e8a4e747200e2134bf890c160ae51c0caf46e20ba4f020","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅希亚一面帮高登引开娜斯提，一面帮衰老的女妖寻人。随后，娜斯提收到了那支丢失的骨笔的残片。另一边，高登押着费尔南和奥克里，取道莱茵生态园的地下运输通道，试图将违禁品运出园区。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我来晚了。今天的工作有些忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅、梅希亚......请你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我需要......想起，更多......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的情况很特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的记忆像是枯枝上仅存的败叶，拂去灰尘或许能令它们恢复些许色泽，但太过用力，只会造成伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不该去拨弄它们的，若不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，拂哀菈女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我需要......知道，需要......想起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开家乡之后的回忆对您来说并不愉快，但如果您坚持......那就闭上眼睛吧，我们继续尝试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有些费力地，梅希亚把她总带在身边的那台老旧的幻灯机搬上了桌子。\n随着她指尖滑动，玻璃幻灯片落入卡槽，一幅陌生的景象笼罩了女妖衰老的身躯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g4_towerroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我记得，那个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她......提过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那里，高塔......镣铐，血。"},{"type":"narration","text":"缓慢地，模糊地，一段记忆在幻灯机投射出的背景上晕开。梅希亚辨认出一具衰老的身躯被锁在墙边，几个穿着长袍的人影进进出出。\n一些血的气味，一段可怖的旋律，一些术式的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚的高塔，您被囚禁在那里过？......作为实验对象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若不是一位巫妖出手相助，您几乎就要被埋葬在高塔术师的书页之下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"圣城的安魂教堂，您在那里为人送葬？是为您流落在外的同胞，还是为您族群的......仇敌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但那些天使并不领情，对吗？他们的葬礼上需要的是欢笑，而不是您的......哀哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您差点被戍卫队逮捕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您来到哥伦比亚......是横穿了整片拓荒地，甚至......骸骨荒原？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那片野兽都不敢踏足的、被风沙切割得千疮百孔的土地？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您最后还是来到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，偏偏是这座园区？您是来寻找什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，这里也有......树。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的树，也在枯萎、腐败......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枯萎、腐败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的确有一座生态园，它也确实刚刚发生过一场令人不忍注目的事故，枯萎、腐败，如您所说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那座生态园的主人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是另一位女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，您认识它吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那支在生态园酿成大祸，后来又被高登收缴的骨笔，就这样洁白无辜地躺在梅希亚的手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的气息......她在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，您是来找人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拂哀菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_2035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......我想见她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用把身子压得这么低，奥克里，你背上的施术装置已经歪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是莱茵生命的地下通道，说不定连墙壁里都有纳米监听器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，我们还要当心园区的报警系统......既然是帮高登长官办事，为什么还得躲着警卫队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得有几个下属能得到他的完全信任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看电梯的小警卫都有可能是哪位大人物的第三只眼睛。要是出了岔子，牵扯出的问题可比这几箱违禁品严重得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们这两个没有相关利益的外来人，反倒是替他“销赃”的最佳人选？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过有一个问题我确实想不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干活的人有了，接应的人也安排了，那躺在办公室里喂喂鳞兽听听小曲不是更好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亲自过来监工可是会惹上麻烦的啊，长官？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我当然是来为我的小家伙们送行的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别随便乱晃，蠢货，源石技艺还原装置的保护壳差点就撞墙上了！我跟你们说过，要把这批货看得比自己的命还重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您也一定记得，要是我俩把这些“小家伙们”安全送出去，管好自己的嘴——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的账一笔勾销。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别掉以轻心。娜斯提不愿撤出生态园，宁愿面对满墙失败品也要继续研究，甚至昼夜不停。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_4214_cairn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她现在就在我们的头顶上？我好像听到她的脚步声了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，梅希亚会帮我们解决这个小问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小梅，小梅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，听得到，高登长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那边怎么样？要是计划失败，就算是出面硬拖，也得把娜斯提拖住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您放心，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为我的疏忽，所以才出了那么多意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会盯紧娜斯提主任，确保她离开莱茵生态园，为你们争取尽可能多的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看，关键时刻连小梅都变得靠谱起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们俩给我上点心，快到运输口了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，长官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费尔南小姐的听觉真是敏锐啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_2046_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅希亚小姐，您的身份可能会暴露，需要我们以应急管理监督协会的身份出面干预吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把梅兰德的招牌用在更重要的地方吧，高登长官的秘书是个很好用的幌子，我这里不用费心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅兰德特工","speakerId":"avg_npc_2046_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据二组白天收集到的情报，莱茵的技术人员确实撤出了实验区，只有娜斯提主任和一名助手出入这个场馆，只不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她待在这里的时间长到令人费解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅兰德特工","speakerId":"avg_npc_2046_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅兰德特工","speakerId":"avg_npc_2046_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，作为您的小队成员，我们应该更信任您的判断，莱茵生命可能确实在展馆地下藏了什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用道歉，监视各家科技公司本来就是我的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅兰德特工","speakerId":"avg_npc_2046_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们要进一步搜查，娜斯提主任那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，依我的计划，如果一切顺利，保守估计能为我们争取二十分钟的调查时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备了一份，她无法拒绝的礼物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提主任，生态园和浮空种植单元的程序就是用这套系统实现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然隔空控制物体是女妖之所长，但放弃以声音作为媒介，将咒言封存在模块之中，依靠自循环修复漏洞，可是划时代的发明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是全由咒言驱动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少看一些纯是猜想的论文，斯凯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包含我在内的大多数人对女妖的了解有限，我听说她们栖居在河谷之中，很少离开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来哥伦比亚历练之前，你也待在那里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最初的记忆来源于卡兹戴尔，后来我被同族收养，被带回了河谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是个怎样的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与世无争的好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河流边的草地和丛林茂密，花朵不败，果实不落。不说天灾，连雨水都极少侵扰它的安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，你为什么要走呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么晚了，是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主、主任，快过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是不是你丢的那支骨笔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那支骨笔......的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜斯提和斯凯脚边，被切断的锥形笔尖在地上来回滚动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太过分了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生态园的事故不是意外也不是谁的恶作剧，一切都是有备而来。针对你，或是针对莱茵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一种方法可以把事情弄清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨卡兹语）指引。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜斯提手中的残片应咒言飘浮起来，莹白的光晕包裹着破碎的骨笔。锥形笔尖打转了几圈之后，向某个方向缓缓飞去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来另一截骨笔离此不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实有可能是个圈套，但我有不得不去的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这支骨笔上......有我熟悉的咒言的痕迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
